span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Lumbar\" title=\"Lumbar\">Lumbar</a> - can be found in an alley north of the <a href=\"/wiki/Basilisk_Gate_Barracks\" title=\"Basilisk Gate Barracks\">Basilisk Gate</a> at <span class=\"bg3wiki-coordinates\">X:&nbsp;125&nbsp;Y:&nbsp;-28</span>. He reveals the group was planning to escape by boat, so Thrumbo is probably by the water.</li>\n<li><span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon bg3wiki-round-image\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Morbus\" title=\"Morbus\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/7/7a/Portrait_Morbus.png/30px-Portrait_Morbus.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/7/7a/Portrait_Morbus.png/45px-Portrait_Morbus.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/7/7a/Portrait_Morbus.png/60px-Portrait_Morbus.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Morbus\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/7/7a/Portrait_Morbus.png/30px-Portrait_Morbus.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"30\" height=\"30\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/7/7a/Portrait_Morbus.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Morbus\" title=\"Morbus\">Morbus</a> - can be found in the graveyard north of the <a href=\"/wiki/Forge_of_the_Nine\" title=\"Forge of the Nine\">Forge of the Nine</a> at <span class=\"bg3wiki-coordinates\">X:&nbsp;22&nbsp;Y:&nbsp;17</span>. He only remembers that Thrumbo told him 'Down the stairs, across the sand.'</li>\n<li><span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon bg3wiki-round-image\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Sacrum\" title=\"Sacrum\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/7/7d/Portrait_Sacrum.png/30px-Portrait_Sacrum.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/7/7d/Portrait_Sacrum.png/45px-Portrait_Sacrum.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/7/7d/Portrait_Sacrum.png/60px-Portrait_Sacrum.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Sacrum\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/7/7d/Portrait_Sacrum.png/30px-Portrait_Sacrum.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"30\" height=\"30\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/7/7d/Portrait_Sacrum.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Sacrum\" title=\"Sacrum\">Sacrum</a> - can be found north of <a href=\"/wiki/Beehive_General_Goods\" title=\"Beehive General Goods\">Beehive General Goods</a> <span class=\"bg3wiki-coordinates\">X:&nbsp;-78&nbsp;Y:&nbsp;-98</span>. He mentions to search for empty abandoned houses, especially the wardrobes.</li></ul>\n<!-- \nNewPP limit report\nCached time: 20260715092615\nCache expiry: 86400\nReduced expiry: false\nComplications: []\nCPU time usage: 0.044 seconds\nReal time usage: 0.045 seconds\nPreprocessor visited node count: 909/1000000\nPost‐expand include size: 7099/4194304 bytes\nTemplate argument size: 893/4194304 bytes\nHighest expansion depth: 19/200\nExpensive parser function count: 3/750\nUnstrip recursion depth: 0/20\nUnstrip post‐expand size: 1601/5000000 bytes\nExtLoops count: 0/1000\nLua time usage: 0.027/7.000 seconds\nLua memory usage: 891344/52428800 bytes\n-->\n<!--\nTransclusion expansion time report (%,ms,calls,template)\n100.00%   36.634      1 -total\n 65.81%   24.109      1 Template:Disambig\n 64.81%   23.743      1 Template:Ambox\n 31.93%   11.696      3 Template:MdCharLink\n 19.05%    6.977      3 Template:Icon_link\n 17.74%    6.497      3 Template:Icon_text\n 14.21%    5.205      7 Template:Trim\n  7.37%    2.701      4 Template:Icon\n  5.43%    1.989      3 Template:Ifempty\n  1.42%    0.520      3 Template:Coords\n-->\n\n<!-- Saved in parser cache with key bg3wiki:pcache:idhash:51095-0!canonical and timestamp 20260715092615 and revision id 284702. Rendering was triggered because: page-view\n -->\n</div>"}